Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Authenticated project descriptors endpoint

The site/search configuration console introspects a project's models,
relationships, and fields through the descriptors document. That was only
available on the public API, which now serves discoverable projects
exclusively - but sites are configured before a project is made
discoverable.

Extracts descriptor building into a Descriptors service and adds an
authenticated GET /core_data/projects/:id/descriptors (project show?
policy). The public v1 endpoint emits the same document via the service.

